2. **Passage has zero protection mechanisms** — no deferral, grace period, forbearance, or hardship fund. Most rigid terms in Canadian student lending, applied to the population with the least safety net.

3. **CE model adjustment: +3pp central** (10% → 13% default rate), band +2-5pp. If disbursement stops at 12 months: +10-15pp (→ 20-25%).

4. **Two recommended grant conditions:**
